# 仓库内文本文件统一使用 LF，与 .editorconfig、Prettier 的 endOfLine 保持一致，
# 不再依赖各开发者本机的 core.autocrlf 设置。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换。
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.node binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.zpx binary
*.asar binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
